--- stdout ---
Usage: managed-machine platform [--json|--human]

Report the platform this process runs on as one record:
platform (one of darwin/arm64, linux/arm64, linux/amd64, windows/arm64, windows/amd64),
os, arch (the native machine architecture, not the binary's) and
emulated (true when the binary runs under architecture emulation).

Options
-h, --help    Show this usage and perform no probe
--json        Return the record as one JSON document
--human       Render the record in a readable form
